6:  *   Pass 1: Preliminary scan of ALL pages to build global novel context,
7:  *           detect all chapters/bab, detect characters, and identify/filter
8:  *           repetitive running headers, footers & "Volume 1" spam in early pages.
9:  *   Pass 2: Chunking mode with concurrent worker pool for fast translation
